                <pb facs="0925" n="805" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg805"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3903: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-26T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26, 1922—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>187. Your 318 July 24, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>It is Department’s view that you should neither aid nor actively oppose proposed
                    loan which is a British enterprise. Department does not desire to curtail any
                    legitimate independent effort which Pacific Development Corporation may consider
                    advisable in obtaining liquidation of its loan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
